+"%busybox_exe%" sh "%kotlin_cli_target_dir%\bin\launcher.sh" %* & call :exitWithErrorLevel
+
+:exitWithErrorLevel
+@rem We use "%COMSPEC%" /d /c exit so that and/or operators work properly when calling kotlin.bat directly from a script
